{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "SCP: Project Pneuma",
    "steam_appid": 3872430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872430/extras/6a37a1bc980332dcc765965760eec264.avif?t=1752739285\" width=615 height=300 /></span><strong></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world ended the moment the Foundation lost control.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SCP: Project Pneuma</i> is a single-player psychological survival horror experience set during the aftermath of <strong>Project Echelon</strong>, a secret protocol that shattered containment across the globe. As <strong>Dr. Alexander Kolchak</strong>, a SCP Foundation researcher and one of the few survivors of <strong>Site-63</strong>, you must journey across a haunted exclusion zone to reach <strong>Site-19</strong>\u2014and the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the deeper you go, the more the world twists. Reality warps. Familiar places corrode. You're being hunted\u2014not just by anomalies like <strong>SCP-106</strong>, <strong>SCP-173</strong>, or <strong>SCP-049-2</strong>\u2014but by your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together what happened through journals, voice logs, and environmental storytelling. Confront horrific SCPs with stealth, scarce resources, and quick thinking. Endure hallucinations that test what\u2019s real\u2014and what isn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872430/extras/10942d7d13a6b110d881b3e50b4d0ece.avif?t=1752739285\" width=615 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>: Sanity-based visual and audio distortions, hallucinations, and emotional breakdowns heighten dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iconic SCP Threats</strong>: Survive terrifying encounters with SCP-106, SCP-939, SCP-049, SCP-239, SCP-173, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Experience</strong>: Explore a gripping story of collapse, grief, and survival in the SCP universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi-Open World</strong>: Traverse the foggy forests and ruins of northern Michigan, uncovering lore and navigating danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Mechanics</strong>: Engage in gaze-based SCP-173 encounters, SCP-106\u2019s pocket dimension puzzles, and reality distortion sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Gameplay</strong>: Stealth, limited combat, resource management, and exploration combine in over 6+ hours of atmospheric tension.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872430/extras/6a37a1bc980332dcc765965760eec264.avif?t=1752739285\" width=615 height=300 /></span><strong></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world ended the moment the Foundation lost control.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SCP: Project Pneuma</i> is a single-player psychological survival horror experience set during the aftermath of <strong>Project Echelon</strong>, a secret protocol that shattered containment across the globe. As <strong>Dr. Alexander Kolchak</strong>, a SCP Foundation researcher and one of the few survivors of <strong>Site-63</strong>, you must journey across a haunted exclusion zone to reach <strong>Site-19</strong>\u2014and the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the deeper you go, the more the world twists. Reality warps. Familiar places corrode. You're being hunted\u2014not just by anomalies like <strong>SCP-106</strong>, <strong>SCP-173</strong>, or <strong>SCP-049-2</strong>\u2014but by your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together what happened through journals, voice logs, and environmental storytelling. Confront horrific SCPs with stealth, scarce resources, and quick thinking. Endure hallucinations that test what\u2019s real\u2014and what isn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872430/extras/10942d7d13a6b110d881b3e50b4d0ece.avif?t=1752739285\" width=615 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>: Sanity-based visual and audio distortions, hallucinations, and emotional breakdowns heighten dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iconic SCP Threats</strong>: Survive terrifying encounters with SCP-106, SCP-939, SCP-049, SCP-239, SCP-173, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Experience</strong>: Explore a gripping story of collapse, grief, and survival in the SCP universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi-Open World</strong>: Traverse the foggy forests and ruins of northern Michigan, uncovering lore and navigating danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Mechanics</strong>: Engage in gaze-based SCP-173 encounters, SCP-106\u2019s pocket dimension puzzles, and reality distortion sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Gameplay</strong>: Stealth, limited combat, resource management, and exploration combine in over 6+ hours of atmospheric tension.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Project Pneuma is a cinematic first-person survival horror game set in the SCP universe. As Dr. Alexander, survive a betrayal, evade deadly anomalies like SCP-096, SCP-939, SCP-173, SCP-239 and uncover the secrets of a collapsing world. Fear is your only companion.",
